        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "If Planck [1] and Nernst [3] had used the relation  $ \\rho(\\nu, T) = 8\\pi h\\nu^2\\bar{U}(\\nu, T)/c^3 $, then instead of Eq. (2) they would have obtained",
